<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:36 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Colossians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Kô-lô-se</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kô-lô-se</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col</para>
  <para style="mt">Kô-lô-se</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Phao-lô, dro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu tyauq iq trôôch Kơy Plêêk, ji Ti-mô-thê, adro oh ay ku haay, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />atăq ka khơl vah ji oh ay muuyq xuum đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh aduq Kô-lô-se. Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, truh tol oh ay.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />'Wot kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, Vaq ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, đom tôôy aduq apôôy ka oh ay, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />vii heq tameng truh xuum tuôq ku oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu ji đom xuum xung xiaq đơu oh ay e đôôyq dii dêq hloay khơl vah, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />vii kơq xuum takôô gamưh jah deng 'miêh ka oh ay tol kaluh tal plêêk, laa varơuq đơu oh ay heq tameng tuôôy adroyq đom apok đaauq ku varơuq dik, nưq laa Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />laa varơuq đong măn đom katul oh ay, đơu Hêêl Kaxay nưq đong vlôh raak play ji jah kôt tok tol dêq dêh araak đaleq, yôôych kung đanưq măn đom oh ay, xing hngơy oh ay heq tameng ji hok xet vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk đom varơuq dik, <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />dang đaji oh ay heq hok xet xing Ê-phap-ra, adro waak varơuq thier xung xiaq ku 'wot, ay laa muuyq adro xapok muuyq xuum ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh thêq ka 'wot, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />ji laa adro heq kahnoq ka 'wot xet xuum xung xiaq ku oh ay đom Kơy Phool Hiel.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kơq anưq, xing hngơy 'wot tek đanưq, yôôych 'wot hloay hloay apôôy ka oh ay ji apôôy vôôch, xôq ka oh ay jah galơh galaay varơuq xet hlolh xuum trôôch Kadraq đom tôôy varơuq khôôt xet ji hlolh xet danưng kooy, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />xôq tawaak hooy kach taxưngq dii Lôôk đom tôôy varơuq kaxay iq Kadraq, raak play đom tưng varơuq kaxay tamaq, jah kôt tok đom varơuq nhonq xet Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />jah kalh paraat dii galơh galaay paraat kalh tyauq tong taay yaak tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq, xôq jah truh tôôy varơuq raanq uunq ji atuq xuum dii xuum hlah hlaak, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />tơơk tưp apok kuh kway Vaq, Kơy heq khienq oh ay đu varơuq măn đom varơuq jưq phon kơ ngiip dii khơl vah đom varơuq tađnah. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Jơq Kơy nưq heq wơơt haay klơlh qwuyen ku varơuq kamơng jaluk, ji jarooy haay truh daak dêh ku Koot xung xiaq ku Kadraq, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />đom Koot nưq, haay e varơuq wơơt xok, nưq laa varơuq ka'lăk karôp maroh. <verse eid="COL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Koot nưq laa long lơuq ku Kơy Plêêk leh hloq ik, laa Kơy pajêêk vlôh adroyq dik đom tôôy paroh. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Vii đom Koot, tôôy paroh tol plêêk long 'laarq vari, tuôông hloq ik long tuôông be hloq ik, raay heq jah jêêk panưk. Ju e laa ngôôy vuua, long qwuyen xakaq 'yo, long padrok, long qwuyen da uh, yôôych dêq hloay raay jah jêêk panưk vlôh xing Koot ji vii Koot. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Koot nưq e adroyq tôôy paroh, ji tôôy paroh jư kajưk dii mamuuyq đom Koot. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Koot nưq kung laa akoq ku xăk xamơk, nưq tayuup vah. Jơq Koot nưq laa kapa tep dik, laa Kơy pa iir vlôh adroyq nhưk xing đom katul khơl kaxêêt, xôq ka Koot nưq dơơp Kơy dưk adroyq dik tol tôôy paroh. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Vii Kơy Plêêk heq hlah xuum xôq ka tôôy varơuq xaleep măn đom Koot, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />ji gamưh Koot xôq dơơp tagu hlê tôôy paroh dii jơq Kadraq, ju laa kaluh paroh 'laarq vari, long kaluh paroh tol plêêk, vii heq taway truh varơuq dơơp tagu xing Koot nưq, gamưh vahaap tol gay charăk ku Koot. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Tuôôy adroyq, tuôôy oh ay biq 'yo laa manih leh qween xet ji laa khơl tachơơl đom xuum biit, đom kaluh varơuq dơơp xơk tauq, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />đơu juneq, oh ay heq jah dơơp tagu hlê gamưh varơuq kaxêêt đom xăk xamơk ku Koot, xôq dưk kahnoq vlôh oh ay adroyq kangưưr Kadraq, laa khơl adro hlăng vah, leh hlêêl tachoot, ji be e aduq đnooy ik, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />nưq laa atoh oh ay kưq măn đom xuum tuôq, chiuq vlok rayah, dưk kajưk, ji leh biq vlôh klơlh xuum takôô gamưh ku Hêêl Kaxay đơu oh ay heq tameng, laa Hêêl Kaxay heq jah padoh taboon vlôh ka tôôy paroh 'laarq plêêk, đơu vii anưq, gô, Phao-lô, heq jêêk vlôh muuyq adro xapok.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Juneq gô hlah hlaak đom kaluh pơơl dal ku gô vii oh ay, ji bơơn xăk xamơk gô, gô đong galôp viik kaluh phon măn thiuq đom kaluh varơuq jiq jiêh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, vii kơq xăk xamơk Kadraq, nưq laa tayuup vah, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />đơu xing đnư, gô heq vlôh jêêk muuyq dro xapok, tyauq varơuq jư xakaq ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu varơuq nưq heq jah pahnăp ka gô vii oh ay, xôq payôôch varơuq padoh taboon apok ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />nưq laa varơuq kadook heq jah padu kinq xaloot kaluh đơơy xanưm ji tuôôt 'ngưng adrơơk, đơu juneq, varơuq kadook nưq heq jah kahnoq vlôh ka khơl vah ku Kadraq, <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />laa khơl adro đơu Kơy Plêêk xung kahnoq vlôh đaleq laa varơuq karoh e tađnah tađnaak ku varơuq kadook neq đom katul kaluh tamooy kadrơy, nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đom oh ay, nưq laa varơuq takôô gamưh tađnah tađnaak. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Nưq laa Kơy đơu 'wot padoh taboon, tuôôy đnooy panhăk tôôy adro, ji pato dayq tôôy adro dii dêq hloay varơuq khôôt xet, xôq 'wot hnoq ik dưk kahnoq vlôh tôôy adro laa xaleep đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kung vii varơuq nưq đơu gô dơơp galeh galal, tahmơt tyauq đaji varơuq ku Kadraq đong dưk dơơp dii da uh đom gô.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Vii gô xung oh ay xet gô e varơuq tahmơt kôt đaleq ka oh ay, ji ka khơl tuôq aduq Lao-đi-xê, kung dii xet toleq adro đnoyq koq hmưq hloq mot gô đom phon xăk xamơk, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />xôq xuum oot jah ahluk ahlul, tuôôy jah anguk dii mamuuyq đom xuum xung xiaq, ji wih truh tôôy varơuq viik vauq ku varơuq xet hlolh galơh galaay kajưk, jarooy truh varơuq nhonq xet varơuq kadook ku Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />đơu đom Kadraq laa varơuq kadook xôq dêq hloay kaluh varơuq khôôt xet ji hlolh xet. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Gô đnooy varơuq neq xôq be kơyq hnoq ik pa ôôh lar oh ay bơơn apok đnooy adô aluut. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Vii long jơq laa gô leh măn đom xăk xamơk, bơh gô măn dii oh ay đom danưng kooy, hlah hlaak ji 'yo hloq varơuq e adroyq e atêq đom oh ay, kung dii paraat kalh ku xuum tuôq ku oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Vii anưq, hloay tuôôy oh ay heq nhonq xok Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu dơơp Lôôk, yôôych dayh tawaak hooy đom Kadraq, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />chiuq vlok rayah ji jah kôt tok đom Kadraq, kung jah dơơp ka kajưk đom xuum tuôq dang đaji oh ay heq jah pato dayq, ji raah jôh đom varơuq kuh kway.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Dayh rơơt rol, leh kheoq muuyq kơyq nưq hnoq laa adro rôp jư oh ay bơơn apok tagêh pa ôôh ji apok pato hong heng, tyauq apok taboon ku koot manih, tyauq kaluh huuy xarooy ku dêh araak, đơu leh tyauq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Vii đom Kadraq, dêq hloay varơuq đu tolh ku yaak Kơy Plêêk măn đom xăk xamơk, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />ji oh ay heq jah dơơp ka đu tolh đom Kadraq, Kơy laa ưk ku tôôy qwuyen xakaq ji qwuyen da uh, <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />đơu đom Kơy nưq, oh ay kung jah goch kađuh dii pheep goch kađuh leh aalq xing ti manih dưk dơơp, bơh bơơn varơuq look ka'lăk katik xăk xamơk, nưq laa bơơn pheep goch kađuh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />vii heq jah up dii Kadraq đom pheep bap-tem, ji đom Kadraq oh ay heq jah riirh hlê gamưh xuum tuôq aduq taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy heq dơơp Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Truh phon oh ay, đong tuôôy kaxêêt hlơơp đom kaluh lôp kadrôôp ji đom varơuq xăk xamơk koq goch kađuh ku oh ay, yôôych Kadraq heq dơơp ka oh ay kung riirh dii Kadraq, vii heq ka'lăk kaluh lôp kadrôôp ka haay, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />heq ka'lăk dêq jơyq valơk truh varơuq tachơơl hlê haay, nưq 'miêh laa varơuq tachơơl dii haay, ji Kadraq heq ka'lăk ni klơlh katul kaluh nưq vlôh, tuôôy đongq đing ni muut gay charăk, <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />vih ka'lăk kaluh qwuyen xakaq ji qwuyen da uh, Kadraq heq khienq oot dơơp varơuq xagiel ka tôôy manih, tuôôy jah jay oot tol gay charăk.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Vii anưq, te xôq kơyq xưh xadrah oh ay đom tuôông xa ji đom tuôông hôôch, long đom tuôôy ku hngơy lêh, hngơy xiêk đơơu, long hngơy Sa-bat, <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />đơu kaluh nưq vơ laa long lơuq ku kaluh varơuq jeq truh, măn dong dik thuôk truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Te xôq dro leq dơơp oh ay hlơơp phon kadrool, tuôôy kahnoq vlôh xiaq trôôch veeh apôôt xăk ji varơuq kuh kul yaak plêêk, gamưh muut kaluh kajoq xăk jek heq 'yo hloq, jêêk vlôh katơơk galơh kach leh yuôôr aal xing xuum biit tyauq xăk xamơk ku ni, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />ji be pagăp riit dii Akoq, đơu xing aduq Kadraq, dêq xăk xamơk xing kaluh atu taboot ji talơy aluq alaq jah riirh ji hooy hlê dii mamuuyq; xăk xamơk nưq kôt tok dii paraat kôt tok truh xing Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Atoh oh ay heq kaxêêt kung dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, vlôh klơlh kaluh ganuun ku dêh araak, yôôych vii aleq đom tuôôy đong măn riirh đom katul dêh araak, oh ay laayq tameng tyauq kaluh ganuun ku ni: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Leh adrơk, leh nhemq, leh vêq!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />nưq laa kaluh ganuun đơu dêq hloay raay jarooy truh varơuq hruh hrek tuôôy xok dơơp, tyauq kaluh ganuun ji apok pato dayq ku koot manih? <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Dêq hloay nưq laa varơuq kajoq, ju tađnưk varơuq kaveeh khôôt xet đom lêh lâp vlôh kadih, kung varơuq apôôt xăk ji pơq parêq ku xăk xamơk, yôôych be ik xung liq xôq tachơơl hlê hmưch trôôch ku xăk xamơk.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Vii anưq, atoh oh ay heq jah dơơp ăm riirh hlê dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych dayh axek akhiim kaluh varơuq măn tol plêêk, aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đong 'ngôôy pi bơ Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Dayh wih xuum biit truh kaluh varơuq măn tol plêêk, leh aalq kaluh thưq măn 'laarq vari. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Vii oh ay heq kaxêêt, ji varơuq riirh oh ay heq jah kadook dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đom Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Tuôôy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa varơuq riirh ku oh ay, rama vlôh, yôôych oh ay kung hnoq rama vlôh dii Kadraq đom tađnah tađnaak.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Vii nưq, dayh dơơp kaxêêt kaluh phon 'laarq vari — đaji apuq atrăp, klơl 'yêq, tuut taak, hmưch trôôch xơk tauq, ji hmưch trôôch, đơu hmưch trôôch laa akuh vangưl, <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Vii kaluh varơuq neq đơu đơơt tôq jaraq ku Kơy Plêêk đong truh, <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />đơu adroyq nưq, oh ay kung heq tawaak hooy đom kaluh varơuq nưq, tuôôy oh ay măn riirh đom kaluh nưq. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Bơh juneq oh ay pheq ka'lăk kaluh varơuq neq — đaji jaraq karưn, tôq dayh, xơk tauq, đnooy ra ơơh, kung apok a'moh vlôh xing huuy oh ay. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Te đnooy pa ôôh mamuuyq, vii heq leh ka'lăk koot manih duut kung kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />ji heq hlưp muut koot manih đơơu, nưq laa manih đong jah dơơp đơơu đom varơuq hlolh xet tyauq long lơuq ku Kơy jêêk panưk ni, <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />laa aduq đơu leh e manih Hi Lap ji manih Jo Thaiq, manih goch kađuh ji manih leh goch kađuh, manih leh e xa hok, manih Si-the, manih xapok, manih rayơh rayơơy, bơh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa tôôy varơuq, ji đom tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Vii anưq, đaji khơl jah rơơlh ku Kơy Plêêk, laa manih vah ji jah xung xiaq, dayh hlưp xok xuum angơuq, kaxay xuum, apôôt xăk, xuum be huq, atuq xuum, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />chiuq uunq mamuuyq ji ka'lăk kadrôôp mamuuyq, atoh đaji kơyq nưq e varơuq ramooy dii khơl drơy, yôôych đaji Lôôk heq ka'lăk kadrôôp oh ay đaleq, oh ay kung duh pheq dang đanưq. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Bơh taalh kaluh varơuq nưq, pheq hlưp xok xuum xung xiaq, nưq laa thơơl taboot ku varơuq xaleep. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Dayh xôq varơuq hrok hrol ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xakaq 'yo đom xuum oh ay, đơu oh ay kung heq jah taayh truh varơuq hrok hrol nưq đom muuyq xăk xamơk ji dayh kahnoq vlôh xuum xet ơơn. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Dayh xôq ka apok Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn đom oh ay kach galơh galaay, tuôôy pato dayq bơơn dêq hloay varơuq khôôt xet, ahmưk nhăk mamuuyq bơơn kaluh thi thiên, kaluh baai kacheeu ayuôôt ji kaluh linh khuk, kacheeu dii varơuq xet vanong đom xuum oh ay deng ka Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Tôôy varơuq đơu oh ay dơơp, ju bơơn apok đnooy long bơơn varơuq dơơp, dayh dơơp dêq hloay đom yal Lôôk, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, gamưh Kadraq kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq. <verse eid="COL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Khơl dơơp kadrê, dayh tameng apok kanau xăk, đaji nưq laa varơuq taxưngq đom Lôôk. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Khơl dơơp kanau, dayh xiaq kadrê xăk, ji te dơơp ra ơơh dii kadrê. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Khơl dơơp koot, dayh tameng apok miq vaq êêp đom tôôy varơuq, vii neq laa varơuq kaxay xuum Lôôk. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Khơl dơơp vaq, te tache jaraq koot xau êêp, xôq oot leh huq gưlh xuum. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Manih dơơp xapok, dayh tameng apok kôôch êêp đom phon xăk đom tôôy varơuq, leh aalq dii varơuq 'yo jư ku kôôch đaji toleq adro ragơy xok xuum khơl drơy, bơh dii xuum dong dik, kuh yôq Lôôk. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Long oh ay dơơp muuyq varơuq kajoq, dayh dơơp xing aduq xuum klaak đanưq ka Lôôk đơu leh aalq ka khơl drơy, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />vii xet đaneq oh ay hnoq nhonq phon kadrool truh kơ ngiip ku oh ay xing aduq Lôôk. Oh ay đong dơơp xapok ka Lôôk, jơq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Bơh adro leq dơơp varơuq xơk tauq hnoq nhonq hlê varơuq đơu adro nưq heq dơơp kach xơk tauq, ji leh e varơuq bing kơyq.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Adro dơơp kôôch, dayh taway truh ka khơl xapok ku kơy varơuq hyioh jăk ji muuyq atoq, vii xet aneq oh ay kung e muuyq Kôôch tol plêêk.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Dayh garơng kajưk đom varơuq apôôy, tuôôy parol đom varơuq dơơp neq bơơn varơuq kuh kway, <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />kung đaji anguk mamuuyq apôôy ka 'wot, xôq ka Kơy Plêêk luh ka 'wot poop 'mok ku varơuq padoh taboon đaauq, xôq đnooy vlôh varơuq kadook truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kung vii varơuq kadook nưq đơu gô biq rôp karuk, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />aleq ka gô hnoq ik đnooy vlôh apok kadook nưq kach ro raang, đaji gô pheq đnooy. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Dayh xa măn đom varơuq khôôt xet đôôyq dii khơl koq tuôq, dayh xet xok kawat. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Apok xarooy oh ay pheq hloay e vanong, tuôôy athêêp voh muut, xôq xet varơuq nưq thier duh ka oh ay đaleq xôq tơơl hlê dii tôôy muuyq adro.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tôôy varơuq tapiq truh gô, yôôych muuyq adro oh ay thier xung xiaq, muuyq adro xapok muuyq xuum, ji muuyq adro kung dơơp varơuq đom Lôôk, laa Ti-chi-kơ hnoq kahnoq ka oh ay xet, <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />ay nưq laa manih đơu gô patăk truh tavơh oh ay vii kơq neq, nưq laa xôq oh ay xet hêêl truh 'wot, ji xôq oh ay hnoq ik ahluk ahlul xuum oh ay, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />hooy kung laa Ô-nê-sim, dro oh ay muuyq xuum ji xung xiaq, ay nưq e kung dêh xing oh ay, oot hnoq ăm oh ay xet kaluh varơuq măn kađnen.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />A-ri-tak, 'wơyq măn tu ku gô, vôôch hlơq oh ay, kung dii Mak, oh nhu ku Ba-na-ba (oh ay heq nhonq jah apok pato nhăk truh ay nưq; atoh ay nưq truh dii oh ay, yôôych dayh kaa đoonq ay nưq), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />kung đaji Jê-xu, dro jah taayh laa Juk-tu đnoyq. Đom khơl adro e pa iir vlôh laa manih heq goch kađuh, vơ e oot laa khơl 'wơyq waak varơuq vơ e kung gô vii daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, oot laa varơuq hlơq hlôôp ku gô. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Ê-phap-ra vôôch hlơq oh ay, ay nưq vlôh xing oh ay, laa muuyq dro xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tuôôy hloay tahmơt vii oh ay đom varơuq apôôy, xôq oh ay jah dơơp ka dưk kajưk, kôt tok, ji tuôq kajưk đom kaluh iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Vii gô dơơp xanưk truh ay nưq, đaneq ay nưq heq chiuq pơơl hwơơl thier 'ngưng vii oh ay, kung đaji vii khơl tuôq aduq Lao-đi-xê ji aduq Hi-ê-ra-bô-li. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Lu-ka, adro thơy jarơơu xung xiaq, kung Đê-ma, vôôch hlơq oh ay. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Xiin vôôch hlơq khơl oh ay aduq Lao-đi-xê, ji Nim-pha, kung tayuup vah anguk aduq hnhư ku mư nưq. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Tuôôy hla thư neq heq jah đok payôôch đom katul oh ay, pheq chăk đaneq ni kung jah đok aduq Tayuup vah Lao-đi-xê, ji kajưk đaneq oh ay kung duh đok thư xing Lao-đi-xê đnoyq. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Xiin đnooy dii A-chip, đaneq: “Dayh tabông muut varơuq dơơp đơu ay heq nhonq đom Lôôk, xôq ay hnoq ik dơơp payôôch varơuq dơơp nưq.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Apok vôôch hlơq neq jo kadih ti gô — Phao-lô. Dayh văch truh kaluh talơy looy tooy ku gô. Apôôy vanong plêêk măn kung oh ay.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>